+# SquashFS test images
+
+`symlinks.sqfs` contains the files and links used by `TestArchiveSymlinks`.
+It can be rebuilt with squashfs-tools:
+
+```sh
+mkdir -p symlinks/src
+printf hello > symlinks/src/file.txt
+printf 'ordinary data' > symlinks/src/regular.rclonelink
+ln -s file.txt symlinks/src/link.txt
+ln -s missing.txt symlinks/src/broken
+ln -s . symlinks/src/dirlink
+ln -s file.txt symlinks/src/suffixed.rclonelink
+mksquashfs symlinks symlinks.sqfs -noappend -no-xattrs -all-root \
+    -all-time 1234567890 -mkfs-time 1234567890 -processors 1 -no-progress
+```
